    {
      "id": "R3CiSVN0Xg-nYS49rr75z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1417.380490137812,
      "y": 737.001049689316,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0R",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1107793394,
      "version": 61,
      "versionNonce": 418854894,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1770025457725,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "假设这里向边沿移动",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "假设这里向边沿移动",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GnDq93QeAPiz3_ygFB5tH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1260.5342513332066,
      "y": 60.105587930335076,
      "width": 328,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2020609966,
      "version": 264,
      "versionNonce": 317740658,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1770025830136,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "前提：\n① 现在只知道电场力可以让电子移动\n② 磁铁能和磁铁有磁力",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "前提：\n① 现在只知道电场力可以让电子移动\n② 磁铁能和磁铁有磁力",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wVC5atgPa9M52Mo3OGl6W",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1261.8910695560173,
      "y": 272.1607760298199,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0U",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 706672302,
      "version": 61,
      "versionNonce": 1846813746,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1770025675982,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "所以我猜测是运动的时候产生了一个电场力让电子移动",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "所以我猜测是运动的时候产生了一个电场力让电子移动",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "u4gcK7EPiERv_rwMLxiNb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1268.4037672129753,
      "y": 359.0892383939074,
      "width": 547,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 410864306,
      "version": 120,
      "versionNonce": 179710510,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1770025931768,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "那剩下的问题就在于为什么 这种物质+运动 可以产生电场力？",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "那剩下的问题就在于为什么 这种物质+运动 可以产生电场力？",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5ju6DJDF-jBhw88yN9Slg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1262.162338794214,
      "y": 302.0104166968532,
      "width": 681.9400024414062,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1868317106,
      "version": 156,
      "versionNonce": 1091526706,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1770025717286,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "然后人们想出了一个叫“磁场”的东西来解释这个现象,其实我个人感觉就是电场",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "然后人们想出了一个叫“磁场”的东西来解释这个现象,其实我个人感觉就是电场",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
